    "en": "A translucent bar across the top of a site without a sidebar: brand, up to five links, actions. Below 760 px the links fold into a panel under the bar.",
    "id": "Bilah tembus pandang di bagian atas situs tanpa sidebar: merek, hingga lima tautan, dan aksi. Di bawah 760 px tautan terlipat ke panel di bawah bilah."
  },
